    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c441d855ee1edac3269769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实力成长异常迅猛、评价也越来越高的北部玄驹，\n自然成了众人瞩目的焦点，而高尚骏逸则冷静地\n观察着她的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87ca861d426a27672024b1f1cbdd6a1ef5bf88569062a6b87f1edf0aabd282fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
