      "uid": "zhcn:912a21bf86e2beab5a939ad1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于到了比赛当天。高尚骏逸再次对闪耀表演\n说道：自己一定会成为“伟大的赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5444e4a645bdeb806fc98f7c86c452e4c13b30b357945e80bb1ce823ea70f58e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
