    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950a612c5c7353b4cfedc4ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不论是已经被公认为真正强者的劲敌们，还是\n化作震撼时代怪物般的勇猛赛马娘，全部都在\n这座舞台上集结。",
      "source_fingerprint": "534afa7c5302649c973f1e91e354cf0c06234646ab14b90fa105d36ecbfab5da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
