      "uid": "zhcn:5604d9fc832e264d2ef1b0ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸将要从那群强者中正面冲出，并在\n观众面前高声宣告胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fa302f33c267fa074c69c08920fc9ca1db9904fe92b742ca30c5d3f52bd844",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
