    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341d85f2b1026f0c82edc56e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，我决定在适当安排比赛的同时，暂时\n把重点放在锻炼身体上，为她此后的经典级\n道路打好基础。",
      "source_fingerprint": "986c7cbd619c2065518af80da1d55bbd2dde429718b55e19e712929ed6c3fea6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9afc1445aefae1cdfe1933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战后・正因不同，才是你",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceb7d4a8b262590b0413f6a0848f80acc30c0fda4698d8e0b0e7c6f0662cec74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
