    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8615b8ad03b01477931e925d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着新马级赛程即将结束，也到了该为\n高尚骏逸决定经典级目标的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cad9a84a9abb57fea6310a2fe88d6438fac3a02cf723281f8ec20ce53f1bd7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
