    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b469723efc9e1ca01860b324",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠是一生只有一次的大舞台。\n从资质上来看，她完全有机会挑战，\n我也很想让她站上那条路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bd4ab38f73cfbe56116b178e54ad6707a5a539ffd560a07a94eacce9bac7176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
